      "id": 1,
      "text": "Norris City once carried the nickname “Popeye” after a trainman’s joke, a tale that still echoes in the town’s early lore.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10,
        11,
        18
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
